	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.title">Pirate Fisherman</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.hello1">Arr, ye've the look of a landlubber what wants to catch somethin'!</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.hello2">Yo ho! Bait an' rods, matey. Best on this here coast, I swear it on me peg.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.hello3">Shiver me timbers, a customer! Sit a spell on me fine vessel.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.hello4">The sea gives up her treasures to them with proper bait, savvy?</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.hello5">Aye, she's sunk, but she's MY ship. Now, what'll it be?</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.gold">Yer purse: %n% gold, %tokens% bet tokens</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.gold_only">Yer purse: %n% gold</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.buy_bait">%n% %bait% - %price%g</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.buy_rod">%rod% - %price%g</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.rod_none">Finest rod already</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.rod_max">Ye already hold the Captain's Rod! There be nothin' finer on the seven seas.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.rod_bought">A %rod%! Treat 'er well, an' she'll haul up the deep's own riches.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.bait_bought.worm">Arr, %n% juicy worms for ye. That makes %total% in yer tin.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.bait_bought.shrimp">%n% fat shrimp, fresh from me pots! %total% in yer bucket now; the big ones can't resist 'em.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.bait_bought.squid">%n% glow squid, matey, %total% all told. Mind yer fingers; the deep ones bite back.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.no_gold">Ye can't pay? Begone, ye scallywag, 'fore I feed ye to the eels!</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.buy_trap">Fish trap %n%/%max% - %price%g</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.trap_none">All %max% traps set</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.trap_max">Ye've %n% traps in the water already, matey. Any more an' the fish'll unionise.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.trap_bought">Trap number %n% of %max%, set off the coast! Go plunder a dungeon; she'll fill while ye're gone.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.sell">Sell %n% fish: %tokens% tokens</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.sell_gold">Sell %n% fish: %gold% gold</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.sell_none">No fish to sell</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.no_fish">Ye've no fish, ye bilge rat! Come back with a catch.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.sold">%n% fish! Here be %tokens% bet tokens. Take 'em to the Gambler, he'll reroll yer gear for 'em.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.sold_gold">%n% fish! Here be %gold% gold.</string>
